# Netlify

- Build: `npm run build`, publish directory `dist` (see `netlify.toml`).
- SPA fallback: rewrite `/*` to `/index.html` with status 200.
- Never hardcode secrets. Use Netlify environment variables; in Functions use `Netlify.env.get("VAR")`, not `process.env`.
- Keep `.netlify` gitignored.
- Netlify Forms: keep a hidden static form in `index.html` with the same `name` and fields as the React form so detection works at deploy time.
- Prefer framework adapters over custom Functions unless server logic is required.
